            "title": "A Passion for Bridal Beauty",
            "paragraphs": [
              "Emilia Duncan has spent over ten years perfecting her craft — working with brides across London, Croydon, and beyond to create makeup looks that are timeless, elegant, and completely personal.",
              "Every bride is different, and Emilia believes deeply in celebrating that. From the very first consultation through to the wedding morning itself, her approach is calm, collaborative, and entirely focused on bringing your vision to life.",
